# Single Responsibility Per Folder

Read `docs/LAYER_RESPONSIBILITIES.md` before any change.

## Folder Rules (Non-Negotiable)

| Folder | ONLY Does | NEVER Does |
|--------|-----------|------------|
| `collectors/` | Collect jobs → `RawJob` | Parse resumes, email, DB, AI |
| `ai/` | Prompts + model calls | DB, APIs, Celery tasks |
| `services/` | Business logic + publish events | Direct DB, direct `worker.delay()`, Playwright |
| `workers/` | Async Celery tasks | Sync HTTP, cron definitions |
| `scheduler/` | Cron → trigger workers | Scraping, AI, business logic |
| `repositories/` | MongoDB CRUD | AI, Playwright, HTTP, events |
| `events/` | Publish event → queue worker | Business logic, DB, AI |
| `api/v1/` | HTTP in/out | Business logic |

## Service → Worker Communication

```python
# ❌ FORBIDDEN in services/
from app.workers.ats_apply import apply_to_job
apply_to_job.delay(application_id)

# ✅ REQUIRED in services/
from app.events import publish_application_submitted
publish_application_submitted(application_id, user_id)
```

## Apply Job Flow (Reference)

```
ApplicationService.apply()
  → validate
  → ApplicationRepository.update()
  → ApplicationHistoryRepository.log()
  → events.application_submitted.publish()
  → ats_apply worker reacts
```
